  | "TokenId" | "NodeId" | "DefId" | "HirId" | "MirId" | "TypeId" | "SymbolId" | "ScopeId" | "BlockId" | "ValueId" | "InstrId"
}

reserved_keyword = {
    "space" | "use" | "export" | "share" | "const" | "static" | "global" | "region"
  | "type" | "opaque" | "extern" | "form" | "pick" | "trait" | "impl" | "proc" | "intrinsic"
  | "compiler" | "query" | "pass" | "backend" | "diagnostic" | "macro" | "comptime" | "static_assert"
  | "test" | "bench" | "entry" | "pub" | "priv" | "unsafe" | "async" | "inline" | "noinline"
  | "naked" | "interrupt" | "where" | "effects" | "requires" | "operator" | "noexcept"
  | "as" | "for" | "at" | "let" | "set" | "give" | "try" | "defer" | "asm" | "emit" | "assert"
  | "panic" | "unreachable" | "if" | "elif" | "else" | "while" | "loop" | "in" | "break" | "continue"
  | "select" | "when" | "match" | "case" | "with" | "critical" | "mut" | "owned" | "borrow" | "move"
  | "await" | "not" | "and" | "or" | "is" | "self" | "ref" | "dyn" | "true" | "false" | "null"
  | "sizeof" | "alignof" | "offsetof" | "typeof" | "nameof" | "map" | "resource" | "volatile"
  | "atomic" | "user" | "kernel" | "phys" | "mmio" | "dma"
  | "class" | "union" | "bits" | "flags"
}

literal = _{ float_lit | int_lit | bool_lit | null_lit | char_lit | string_lit | list_lit }
list_lit = { "[" ~ ws ~ (list_comp | arg_list)? ~ ws ~ "]" }
list_comp = { expr ~ ws1 ~ "for" ~ ws1 ~ pattern ~ ws1 ~ "in" ~ ws1 ~ expr ~ (ws1 ~ "if" ~ ws1 ~ expr)? }
bool_lit = { "true" | "false" }
null_lit = { "null" }

int_lit = @{ sign? ~ (hex_int | bin_int | oct_int | dec_int) ~ suffix? }
float_lit = @{ sign? ~ digit ~ (digit | "_")* ~ "." ~ digit ~ (digit | "_")* ~ exponent? ~ suffix? }
sign = { "-" }
hex_int = { "0x" ~ hex_digit ~ (hex_digit | "_")* }
bin_int = { "0b" ~ bin_digit ~ (bin_digit | "_")* }
oct_int = { "0o" ~ oct_digit ~ (oct_digit | "_")* }
dec_int = { digit ~ (digit | "_")* }
exponent = { ("e" | "E") ~ ("+" | "-")? ~ digit ~ (digit | "_")* }

char_lit = @{ "'" ~ char_char ~ "'" }
char_char = { escape_seq | !("'" | newline) ~ ANY }
string_lit = _{ raw_string_lit | normal_string_lit }
normal_string_lit = @{ "\"" ~ string_char* ~ "\"" }
string_char = { escape_seq | !("\"" | newline) ~ ANY }
escape_seq = {
    "\\n" | "\\r" | "\\t" | "\\0" | "\\\"" | "\\'" | "\\\\"
  | "\\x" ~ hex_digit ~ hex_digit
  | "\\u{" ~ hex_digit+ ~ "}"
}
raw_string_lit = @{ triple_string_lit | raw_quote_string_lit }
triple_string_lit = { "\"\"\"" ~ (!"\"\"\"" ~ ANY)* ~ "\"\"\"" }
raw_quote_string_lit = { "r\"" ~ (!"\"" ~ ANY)* ~ "\"" }
raw_string_char = { !"\"\"\"" ~ ANY }

line_comment = @{ hash_line_comment | slash_line_comment }
hash_line_comment = { "#" ~ !("[" | "![") ~ (!newline ~ ANY)* }
slash_line_comment = { "//" ~ !"/" ~ (!newline ~ ANY)* }
block_comment = @{ "/*" ~ (!"*/" ~ ANY)* ~ "*/" }
zone_comment = @{ "<<<" ~ (!">>>" ~ ANY)* ~ ">>>" }

ident = @{ (ASCII_ALPHA | "_") ~ ident_continue* }
ident_continue = _{ ASCII_ALPHANUMERIC | "_" }
suffix = @{ ASCII_ALPHA ~ ASCII_ALPHANUMERIC* }
digit = _{ '0'..'9' }
bin_digit = _{ '0'..'1' }
oct_digit = _{ '0'..'7' }
hex_digit = _{ digit | 'a'..'f' | 'A'..'F' }
newline = _{ "\r\n" | "\n" | "\r" }
space = _{ " " | "\t" }
ws = _{ (space | newline | line_comment | block_comment | zone_comment)* }
ws1 = _{ (space | newline | line_comment | block_comment | zone_comment)+ }

// EBNF-name aliases retained for one-to-one rule inventory checks.
WS = _{ ws }
WS1 = _{ ws1 }
NEWLINE = _{ newline }
LETTER = _{ ASCII_ALPHA }
DIGIT = _{ digit }
BINDIGIT = _{ bin_digit }
OCTDIGIT = _{ oct_digit }
HEXDIGIT = _{ hex_digit }
EOF = { EOI }
